s://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-animal-names-for-farm-animals/\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Best Animal Names for Farm Animals: 150+ Barnyard Ideas 🚜\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"From cows and pigs to chickens and sheep, discover charming farm animal names. Perfect for hobby farms, homesteads, and country pets.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Best Animal Names for Farm Animals: 150+ Barnyard Ideas 🚜\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"From cows and pigs to chickens and sheep, discover charming farm animal names. Perfect for hobby farms, homesteads, and country pets.\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\",\"description\":\"Free animal name generator with 989+ animals. Browse thousands of name ideas across 9 categories.\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/animals?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[#f8fafc] text-[#1e293b]\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"bg-white border-b border-gray-200 sticky top-0 z-50\"><nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary hover:text-primary-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/\">🐾 AnimalNameGen</a><div class=\"flex gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/animals/\">Animals</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/guide/japanese-animal-names/\">Guides</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></div></nav></header><main class=\"flex-1\" aria-label=\"Main content\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"Best Animal Names for Farm Animals: 150+ Barnyard Ideas 🚜\",\"description\":\"From cows and pigs to chickens and sheep, discover charming farm animal names. Perfect for hobby farms, homesteads, and country pets.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-18\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-06\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-animal-names-for-farm-animals/\"},\"wordCount\":148,\"articleBody\":\" Farm animals have been our partners for thousands of years. Naming them is a tradition that goes back to the dawn of agriculture. Whether you have a hobby farm, a homestead, or just love country living, these farm animal names celebrate rural life. Cow & Cattle Names <strong>Bessie</strong>, <strong>Buttercup</strong>, <strong>Daisy</strong>, <strong>Clover</strong> are classic cow names. <strong>Angus</strong>, <strong>Hereford</strong>, <strong>Charolais</strong> honor cattle breeds. Playful: <strong>Moo-lan</strong>, <strong>Milkshake</strong>, <strong>Sir Loin</strong>. Pig & Hog Names <strong>Wilbur</strong>, <strong>Babe</strong>, <strong>Porkchop</strong>, <strong>Miss Piggy</strong>, <strong>Hamilton</strong>, <strong>Kevin Bacon</strong>, <strong>Piggly Wiggly</strong>. Pigs are intelligent and deserve clever names. Chicken & Poultry Names <strong>Hennifer</strong>, <strong>Eggatha</strong>, <strong>Cluck Norris</strong>, <strong>Princess Layer</strong>, <strong>Yolko Ono</strong>, <strong>Nugget</strong>, <strong>Feather Locklear</strong>. Sheep & Goat Names <strong>Wooly</strong>, <strong>Dolly</strong>, <strong>Baa-bara</strong>, <strong>Lamb Chop</strong>, <strong>Shearlock</strong>, <strong>Ram-bo</strong>, <strong>Ewe-nice</strong>. Horse & Donkey Names Explore our name generators for {african-civet}, {argonaut}, {arabian-wolf}, {american-bullfrog}, and {african-golden-wolf} to find the perfect name for your companion. <strong>Spirit</strong>, <strong>Thunder</strong>, <strong>Star</strong>, <strong>Dakota</strong>, <strong>Eeyore</strong> (for donkeys!), <strong>Domino</strong>, <strong>Whiskey</strong>, <strong>Bandit</strong>.\",\"image\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-best-animal-names-for-farm-animals.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should farm animals have human names?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Many farmers prefer human names for stock they're close to. It recognizes them as individuals and strengthens bonds.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use these names for non-farm pets?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Absolutely! A dog named Bessie or a rabbit named Clover is charming regardless of the setting.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Best Animal Names for Farm Animals: 150+ Barnyard Ideas 🚜\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-animal-names-for-farm-animals/\"}]}</script><nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-500 flex gap-1 flex-wrap\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><a class=\"hover:text-primary\" href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a><span>/</span><span class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium\">Best Animal Names for Farm Animals: 150+ Barnyard Ideas 🚜</span></nav><article class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><div class=\"text-6xl mb-4\">🚜</div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3\"><span class=\"bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><span>2026-06-18</span><span class=\"text-gray-500\">By BestAnimalNames Editorial Team</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Best Animal Names for Farm Animals: 150+ Barnyard Ideas 🚜</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">From cows and pigs to chickens and sheep, discover charming farm animal names. Perfect for hobby farms, homesteads, and country pets.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">farm names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">barnyard names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">livestock names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">country names</span></div></div><div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 mb-8\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">📋 Table of Contents</h3><ol class=\"space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">1<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#cows\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Cow &amp; Cattle Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">2<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#pigs\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Pig &amp; Hog Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">3<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#chickens\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Chicken &amp; Poultry Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">4<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#sheep\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Sheep &amp; Goat Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">5<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#horses\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Horse &amp; Donkey Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">6<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#faq\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">FAQ</a></li></ol></div><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Farm animals have been our partners for thousands of years. Naming them is a tradition that goes back to the dawn of agriculture. Whether you have a hobby farm, a homestead, or just love country living, these farm animal names celebrate rural life.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Cow &amp; Cattle Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\"><strong>Bessie</strong>, <strong>Buttercup</strong>, <strong>Daisy</strong>, <strong>Clover</strong> are classic cow names. <strong>Angus</strong>, <strong>Hereford</strong>, <strong>Charolais</strong> honor cattle breeds. Playful: <strong>Moo-lan</strong>, <strong>Milkshake</strong>, <strong>Sir Loin</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Pig &amp; Hog Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\"><strong>Wilbur</strong>, <strong>Babe</strong>, <strong>Porkchop</strong>, <strong>Miss Piggy</strong>, <strong>Hamilton</strong>, <strong>Kevin Bacon</strong>, <strong>Piggly Wiggly</strong>. Pigs are intelligent and deserve clever names.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Chicken &amp; Poultry Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\"><strong>Hennifer</strong>, <strong>Eggatha</strong>, <strong>Cluck Norris</strong>, <strong>Princess Layer</strong>, <strong>Yolko Ono</strong>, <strong>Nugget</strong>, <strong>Feather Locklear</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Sheep &amp; Goat Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\"><strong>Wooly</strong>, <strong>Dolly</strong>, <strong>Baa-bara</strong>, <strong>Lamb Chop</strong>, <strong>Shearlock</strong>, <strong>Ram-bo</strong>, <strong>Ewe-nice</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Horse &amp; Donkey Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Explore our name generators for <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/african-civet/\">African Civet<!-- --> Name Generator</a>, <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/argonaut/\">Argonaut<!-- --> Name Generator</a>, <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/arabian-wolf/\">Arabian Wolf<!-- --> Name Generator</a>, <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/american-bullfrog/\">American Bullfrog<!-- --> Name Generator</a>, and <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/african-golden-wolf/\">African Golden Wolf<!-- --> Name Generator</a> to find the perfect name for your companion.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\"><strong>Spirit</strong>, <strong>Thunder</strong>, <strong>Star</strong>, <strong>Dakota</strong>, <strong>Eeyore</strong> (for donkeys!), <strong>Domino</strong>, <strong>Whiskey</strong>, <strong>Bandit</strong>.</p></div><section class=\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Should farm animals have human names?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Many farmers prefer human names for stock they&#x27;re close to. It recognizes them as individuals and strengthens bonds.</p></details><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Can I use these names for non-farm pets?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Absolutely! A dog named Bessie or a rabbit named Clover is charming regardless of the setting.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">🐾 Related Animal Name Generators</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/cow/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐮</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Cow</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/pig/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐷</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Pig</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/chicken/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐔</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Chicken</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/horse/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐴</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Horse</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/pacman-frog/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐸</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Pacman Frog</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/otter/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🦦</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Otter</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/bald-eagle/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🦅</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Bald Eagle</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/peach-faced-lovebird/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🦜</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Peach-Faced Lovebird</div></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📖 Related Naming Guides</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/creative-bird-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Creative Bird Names — Top Creative Picks 🐦</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-sugar-glider/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">How to Name Your Sugar Glider — Complete Guide 🐿️</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-bearded-dragon/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">How to Name Your Bearded Dragon — Complete Guide 🦎</span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📝 Related Articles</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-inspired-by-geography/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🗺️</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Animal Names Inspired by Geography: 200+ Place-Based Ideas 🗺️</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Name your pet after the world&#x27;s most beautiful places. From cities to mountains to rivers, discover geographically inspired animal names.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/pet-naming-psychology-choose-meaningful-name/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🧠</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">The Psychology of Pet Naming: How to Choose a Name That Truly Fits</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Explore the fascinating psychology behind pet naming. Learn how names shape your bond, influence behavior, and discover science-backed tips for choosing the perfect pet name.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-habitat/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🌍</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Habitat: Forests, Oceans, Deserts &amp; More 🌍</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the perfect animal names inspired by different habitats around the world. From deep ocean dwellers to desert survivors, find names rooted in nature&#x27;s most beautiful landscapes.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-color/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎨</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Color: 200+ Ideas for Every Shade 🎨</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Find the perfect name based on your pet&#x27;s color! From snow-white names to midnight-black names, explore 200+ color-inspired animal names organized by every shade of the rainbow.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-inspired-by-mythology/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">⚡</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names Inspired by Mythology: Gods, Heroes &amp; Legends ⚡</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Name your pet after the gods, heroes, and mythical creatures of world mythology. From Greek and Norse to Egyptian and Japanese legends, find powerful, meaningful names.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-that-mean-strength/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">💪</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Animal Names That Mean Strength: Powerful Names for Mighty Pets 💪</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Give your pet a name that embodies power, courage, and resilience. Discover 150+ animal names that mean strength from languages and cultures around the world.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-that-mean-courage/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Animal Names That Mean Courage: 150+ Brave &amp; Bold Ideas 🦁</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-for-rescue-animals/\">